        <ol class="steps">
          <li class="step" id="step-01">
            <h3>Understand the Requirements</h3>
            <p>We start by discussing your business, services, target audience, project goals, and technical requirements. This gives the project a clear direction before design and development begin.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step" id="step-02">
            <h3>Plan the Structure &amp; Design</h3>
            <p>I map out the page structure, content hierarchy, user journey, and visual direction. The goal is to make your offer easy to understand and give visitors a clear path toward taking action.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step" id="step-03">
            <h3>Develop &amp; Connect</h3>
            <p>I build the approved design using the appropriate platform and custom code where needed. This includes responsive layouts, interactive elements, forms, CRM connections, and marketing automations based on the project scope.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="step" id="step-04">
            <h3>Test &amp; Launch</h3>
            <p>Before launch, I check mobile and desktop layouts, links, forms, integrations, functionality, and performance. Once everything is ready, the website or funnel is deployed and handed over.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
